    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=598 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You suddenly get a call that your father has gone missing and this Inn is all that he left behind for you. You must now work at DineInn and handle all operations from Cooking to maintaining the building. <br>The cops are still looking for your father but turns out this building is cursed and many paranormal activities are taking place all around. <br>Restore the DineInn and uncover its secrets!<br><br><u><i><strong>Game play Mechanics: </strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is mostly a cooking and management sim game with a horror theme and story.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><i>The following game play will be Included:</i></u>  <br>- Greet the customers and residents. <br>- Purchase the ingredients from the convenience store. <br>- Cook food for the residents and customers. <br>- Make money for hiring staff for cleaning. <br>- Find notes and Keys hidden secrets and doors in the basement. <br>- Uncover the story about what happened to the previous management of DineInn and your dad. <br> <br><u><i><strong>Future plans:</strong></i></u> <br>- Add more horror and monsters <br>- Add jump-scares <br>- Make a Cozy and Horror game play mode accessible separately in the main menu. <br>- Expand the map so you will walk to deliver food to campers nearby. <br>- Add a vehicle for buying and selling products from far away locations. <br>- Add a Delivery driver for making your delivery runs. <br>- Add a Traveling merchant for bringing rare items on special occasions. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=598 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/947e9441fed639c97a3caeb42b4ac083.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/cf0137e155386f56849b76b4e2058b9f.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You suddenly get a call that your father has gone missing and this Inn is all that he left behind for you. You must now work at DineInn and handle all operations from Cooking to maintaining the building. <br>The cops are still looking for your father but turns out this building is cursed and many paranormal activities are taking place all around. <br>Restore the DineInn and uncover its secrets!<br><br><u><i><strong>Game play Mechanics: </strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is mostly a cooking and management sim game with a horror theme and story.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/d5d34618b58da60f438c858a0332ba7e.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.poster.avif?t=1751373672\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.webm?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450270/extras/e919d9a9b7dfe0b36e72a4ad30231148.mp4?t=1751373672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><i>The following game play will be Included:</i></u>  <br>- Greet the customers and residents. <br>- Purchase the ingredients from the convenience store. <br>- Cook food for the residents and customers. <br>- Make money for hiring staff for cleaning. <br>- Find notes and Keys hidden secrets and doors in the basement. <br>- Uncover the story about what happened to the previous management of DineInn and your dad. <br> <br><u><i><strong>Future plans:</strong></i></u> <br>- Add more horror and monsters <br>- Add jump-scares <br>- Make a Cozy and Horror game play mode accessible separately in the main menu. <br>- Expand the map so you will walk to deliver food to campers nearby. <br>- Add a vehicle for buying and selling products from far away locations. <br>- Add a Delivery driver for making your delivery runs. <br>- Add a Traveling merchant for bringing rare items on special occasions. </p>",
